      "items": [
        "The Vedic Age covers major developments across political, economic, and religious life in ancient India.",
        "The Vedas serve as the primary foundational texts of the period.",
        "Political Organization transitioned from early tribal units to structured governance systems.",
        "Popular assemblies played an active role in Vedic governance and decision-making.",
        "The economy evolved from predominantly pastoral activities to settled agriculture."
